    "format": "subjective",
    "subtopic": "Degree of a Polynomial",
    "difficulty": "MODERATE",
    "stem": "\\(3m^3n^6 + 7m^2n^3 - mn\\) is a polynomial in two variables \\(m\\) and \\(n\\). Write the degree of the polynomial.",
    "solution": "The degree of a polynomial in more than one variable is the highest sum of the powers of the variables in each term.\n\\(3m^3n^6\\) : sum of the powers \\(= 3 + 6 = 9\\)\n\\(7m^2n^3\\) : sum of the powers \\(= 2 + 3 = 5\\)\n\\(-mn\\) : sum of the powers \\(= 1 + 1 = 2\\)\n\\(\\therefore\\) the degree of the polynomial is 9."
  },
